 10px;\"><strong>3. 子宮を貫く濃厚な生中出しフィナーレ：</strong>膣奥深くまで注ぎ込まれる白濁液を受け止め、放心状態でアクメに震える極上の表情。</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;\">\n      <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dh_1783tkfc00095&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e11d48 0%, #be123c 100%); color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.05rem; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 9999px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(225,29,72,0.35);\">▶ FANZA公式で無料サンプル動画＆高画質本編を視聴する</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"work-card-feature\" style=\"border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin: 32px 0; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n  <div style=\"background: #fff1f2; border-left: 5px solid #e11d48; padding: 12px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; border-radius: 6px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #881337; font-weight: 800;\">【第3位】未亡人色欲強●レズ ～禁断の義姉妹熟女の性の果て～</h4>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #475569;\">\n    <div><strong>品番：</strong><span class=\"badge\" style=\"background: #f1f5f9; color: #0f172a; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">AUKG-655 (AUKG-00655)</span></div>\n    <div><strong>主演：</strong><span style=\"color: #e11d48; font-weight: bold;\">月野ゆりね・豊崎清香</span></div>\n    <div><strong>メーカー：</strong>U＆K</div>\n    <div><strong>ジャンル：</strong>ハイビジョン, 独占配信, レズビアン, 未亡人, ドラマ</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Daukg00655&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n      <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/aukg00655/a